# 🧪 Selenium Python UI Automation Framework

This project automates UI test cases for [Practice Automation Testing](https://practice.automationtesting.in) using Selenium WebDriver and Python. It follows the Page Object Model (POM) design pattern and uses PyTest for test execution.

## ✅ Automated Test Cases

- 🔐 Registration and Login
- 🛒 Add and Remove Products from Cart
- 🏠 Add Address to Profile and Verify It Is Saved

